  - name: "Critical Strike (Adult)"
    description: "An adult scores a critical strike on an unmodified 19-20."
  - name: "Elixir of Power and Deceit"
    description: "Every Chiang-Ku knows how to brew the Elixir of Power and Deceit (the catalog gear row Elixir of Power and Deceit, which holds its twelve powers): a potion that lends the drinker one super ability for two weeks and binds him a little more to the brewer with every drink. Only anarchist and evil dragons ever use it, and it never works on dragons or on its own brewer."
  - name: "Learning Spell Magic"
    description: "A Chiang-Ku who studies spell magic, such as a ley line walker''s or a temporal wizard''s, learns it by the usual instruction from a mage. It takes only that O.C.C.''s magic, magic combat, language and reading skills; its other skills do not apply. Its magic grows by level on this Dragon R.C.C. ladder, never the O.C.C.''s."
